# --- staging guard: never let a game SOURCE get committed into the flake ---
# Stage agents download multi-GB sources into per-game worktrees; a stray
# `git add -A` once staged an 8.3 GB rar+iso into a worktree index and bloated
# .git to 45 G. Game sources belong in IPFS/the nix store, never in git.
*.rar
*.iso
*.7z
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.*
*.bin
